WEBVTT

00:03.870 --> 00:05.700
Senior!

00:11.990 --> 00:13.360
Who are you?

00:19.000 --> 00:22.890
Hey, it's me! Me! Maho!

00:22.890 --> 00:26.880
Dunno you. Who's Maho, anyway?
What do you want from me?

00:26.880 --> 00:29.570
You haven't heard about me?!

00:29.570 --> 00:34.870
That so... Oh, that's fine.
I'm so into you now, Senior!

00:34.870 --> 00:36.140
Be my boyfriend!

00:36.140 --> 00:39.140
Huuuuh?!

00:39.140 --> 00:43.900
Hey, no need to be that surprised!
You're hurting me here!

00:43.900 --> 00:48.770
Of course I would if some stranger
suddenly said that to me.

00:48.770 --> 00:51.590
I know a lot about you.

00:51.590 --> 00:52.780
You do?

00:53.210 --> 00:54.530
For instance...

00:54.530 --> 00:58.500
You were confessed to by Senior Himari,
but you turned her down.

00:58.500 --> 01:02.130
Why would you even do that,
you picky eater?

01:02.130 --> 01:02.970
That's...

01:02.970 --> 01:04.420
I know the reason.

01:05.100 --> 01:08.800
You're living with Senior Akane,
that's why.

01:10.510 --> 01:13.710
How... do you know that?!

01:19.350 --> 01:20.730
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL

01:20.730 --> 01:22.310
I HATE IN MY CLASS

01:22.310 --> 01:25.320
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

02:40.220 --> 02:45.020
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

02:45.020 --> 02:48.980
#8 UPPERCLASSMAN

02:49.930 --> 02:52.030
How do you know that?

02:52.030 --> 02:55.530
I know all about
my beloved upperclassman.

02:55.530 --> 02:58.030
Don't play dumb.
That's not enough explanation.

02:58.030 --> 02:59.780
I don't intend to elaborate either.

02:59.780 --> 03:02.540
You... Just who are you?!

03:02.540 --> 03:04.710
So, will you go out with me?

03:04.710 --> 03:08.290
How did our conversation so far
lead to our dating, huh...

03:08.290 --> 03:14.110
I mean, I know about your dangerous
secret with Senior Akane!

03:14.110 --> 03:19.440
So in other words, I can't guarantee
what I'll do if you don't comply to my request!

03:19.440 --> 03:21.930
Are you blackmailing me?!

03:23.050 --> 03:27.290
Everyone, hear me out!
Our senior Saito here...

03:27.290 --> 03:28.810
- Wait, wait, wait!
- ...is living with...

03:28.810 --> 03:29.650
Wow!

03:29.650 --> 03:31.230
So bold, aren't you?

03:31.230 --> 03:31.910
Hey...

03:31.910 --> 03:34.190
Want a taste of my lips?

03:39.550 --> 03:40.620
Shisei...

03:40.620 --> 03:45.260
I'll protect you from any enemies,
no matter how strong they are.

03:45.260 --> 03:47.000
I'll defeat her with my power...

03:47.000 --> 03:51.130
So cute! Cute, cute, cute!
You're just too cute!

03:51.130 --> 03:53.900
Are you a fairy? Or a doll?
Can I have you?

03:53.900 --> 03:55.190
No, you can't!

03:55.190 --> 03:58.410
I want her, I want her!
I'm kidnapping her!

03:58.410 --> 04:00.010
No, you aren't!

04:03.610 --> 04:05.060
See you, Senior!

04:05.640 --> 04:08.640
Yay! School's out!

04:09.050 --> 04:12.900
She smells fishy...
Must be careful.

04:12.900 --> 04:15.550
You were almost kidnapped by her, too.

04:15.550 --> 04:17.820
That's not what I mean.

04:24.410 --> 04:26.910
I'm finally alone after a while today.

04:30.530 --> 04:32.420
Senior!

04:32.420 --> 04:37.920
Um, I'm looking for Hojo in here...

04:37.920 --> 04:39.550
Is he around?

04:40.550 --> 04:42.230
Hojo, not you again?!

04:42.230 --> 04:45.900
Not only Ishikura, but you also made
a cute junior like her fall for you?!

04:45.900 --> 04:49.810
- Even if the heavens allow it, I won't!
- What did I just do to deserve this...

04:51.810 --> 04:54.460
It's a humorous game
in which you kill zombies!

04:54.460 --> 04:56.650
You sure have it rough, Senior!

04:56.650 --> 04:58.320
Whose fault do you think it is?

04:58.320 --> 05:01.410
Why did you even confess to me?

05:01.410 --> 05:03.570
Well, love at first sight, I guess?

05:03.990 --> 05:07.020
Yeah, as if I'd buy it.
I'm not that handsome.

05:08.670 --> 05:10.710
I do think you look cool.

05:11.390 --> 05:12.960
On the outside, that is.

05:12.960 --> 05:14.060
Senior!

05:14.060 --> 05:14.710
Hmm?

05:14.710 --> 05:17.110
Look at me!

05:17.590 --> 05:19.090
Look out!

05:19.090 --> 05:20.840
Nice catch, Senior!

05:20.840 --> 05:23.750
Don't "nice catch" me!
What if you got hurt?!

05:23.750 --> 05:27.700
I mean, I believed that you'd catch me.

05:27.700 --> 05:28.850
Besides...

05:29.220 --> 05:33.290
Wouldn't it be a waste to not try
to do what you want to?

05:33.290 --> 05:36.860
We don't know when we might die.

05:36.860 --> 05:38.860
Well, you do have a point.

05:38.860 --> 05:43.120
That's why I must confess my love
as soon as I start falling for you!

05:43.120 --> 05:45.240
I don't have a crush,
so I wouldn't know.

05:45.240 --> 05:48.250
What a boring life you're living
to not have a crush.

05:48.250 --> 05:49.920
Come on now...

05:50.860 --> 05:54.990
You're living together with Senior Akane,
so don't you love her?

05:55.630 --> 05:56.890
Well...

05:57.690 --> 06:00.130
It's not an issue of love or hate...

06:00.130 --> 06:01.380
In that case...

06:02.740 --> 06:05.150
Let's experience lots of love with me!

06:05.150 --> 06:07.260
It'll be more fun that way!

06:08.190 --> 06:13.270
You just saved me earlier,
so I'll treat you to some sweets in town.

06:13.270 --> 06:14.650
I don't need that.

06:14.650 --> 06:20.030
Anyway, I also want you to show me around
the shopping district near the school.

06:20.030 --> 06:23.360
I got instantly hated by
the girls in my class, so...

06:23.360 --> 06:28.270
I want to know the good sweets stores
to befriend them too, can't I?

06:33.930 --> 06:37.670
So good! Junk food is the best!

06:37.670 --> 06:40.420
Didn't you tell me to show me
around sweets stores?

06:40.420 --> 06:45.640
I did, but burgers are way tastier
than some healthy sweets, no?

06:45.640 --> 06:48.330
Well, I do prefer this one too.

06:48.330 --> 06:53.180
I also love cup noodles, but someone
would scold me if I eat it at home.

06:53.830 --> 06:56.670
Something like "you should
eat something healthier" or so.

06:56.670 --> 06:59.440
We have a strict one at home too...

06:59.440 --> 07:03.650
When I try to hoard some cups,
she always bickers at me.

07:03.650 --> 07:06.230
Oh, a few cup noodles won't hurt, right?

07:06.230 --> 07:11.410
Of course, I know my sister
is saying that out of love for me.

07:11.410 --> 07:13.410
So you have a sister?

07:13.410 --> 07:14.510
Didn't expect that?

07:14.510 --> 07:17.670
Nah, you look like
a little sister too as a whole.

07:17.670 --> 07:19.360
What makes me cute?

07:19.360 --> 07:21.300
You always get so cocky.

07:21.300 --> 07:24.690
But you do think I'm cute, right?
Right?

07:24.690 --> 07:27.650
That impudent attitude
is so like a little sister too.

07:27.650 --> 07:29.690
Is your little sister impudent too?

07:29.690 --> 07:31.560
The most in the world.

07:31.560 --> 07:34.560
However, she's also the cutest,
so that's no problem.

07:34.560 --> 07:36.300
We have a siscon here.

07:36.300 --> 07:39.560
But my big sister
is the cutest in the world!

07:39.560 --> 07:41.360
You're also a siscon.

07:41.360 --> 07:43.980
She's a perfect girl, after all.

07:44.640 --> 07:48.020
Senior, there's sauce on your finger.

07:51.700 --> 07:52.330
Huh?

07:53.330 --> 07:54.330
What are you doing?!

07:54.330 --> 07:56.550
I'm cleaning your finger.

07:56.550 --> 08:01.090
You're the only one getting this special
cleaning service! Better be grateful!

08:01.090 --> 08:03.460
I didn't ask for this!
Also, why did you take a snap?!

08:03.460 --> 08:06.840
It's to leave a trace of memories
of our romantic moment!

08:06.840 --> 08:08.850
It's not romantic!
Delete now!

08:08.850 --> 08:11.600
Kyah! He's assaulting me!

08:13.520 --> 08:15.710
Drat! Where'd she go?!

08:23.750 --> 08:25.170
There you are.

08:25.170 --> 08:28.490
I can't believe you're chasing
a girl till she's out of breath...

08:28.490 --> 08:30.740
You're a pervert.

08:30.740 --> 08:33.140
You just ran off on your own.

08:33.140 --> 08:34.950
Delete that picture.

08:35.240 --> 08:35.750
DELETE PICTURE - CANCEL

08:35.750 --> 08:36.620
DELETED

08:36.980 --> 08:40.620
All right, then. Let's continue
the tour of the shopping district.

08:40.620 --> 08:43.630
Huh? You're not mad at me?

08:43.630 --> 08:45.850
I'm not really mad.

08:45.850 --> 08:48.130
I just can't have you keep that picture.

08:49.900 --> 08:53.980
People said you're
always fighting with her,

08:53.980 --> 08:55.140
but you're a good guy.

08:55.770 --> 08:58.690
So that means you're
really not compatible with her?

08:58.690 --> 09:01.520
Correct. She's my nemesis, after all.

09:01.920 --> 09:05.150
Yet, you two have to live together.
What a hell on earth.

09:05.520 --> 09:06.620
You want to break up?

09:06.620 --> 09:10.590
We can't afford that.
I have my reasons.

09:11.530 --> 09:15.260
You're so good at escorting a girl!
I'm super happy!

09:15.260 --> 09:16.960
Glad to hear that.

09:16.960 --> 09:18.540
I'll be on my way, then.

09:18.990 --> 09:21.120
You do know
how to go home by yourself, right?

09:21.120 --> 09:25.670
Huh? I'm not going home yet.
I'm going to your place.

09:25.670 --> 09:29.510
It's common sense to flirt at
the boyfriend's house to end a date, right?

09:29.510 --> 09:31.010
Your common sense, that is.

09:31.010 --> 09:32.560
Try to run away, and I'll scream!

09:32.560 --> 09:33.140
Say what?!

09:33.140 --> 09:36.760
I mean from our date, you idiot!

09:36.760 --> 09:38.520
- Idiot! Stupid boyfriend!
- Hey!

09:38.520 --> 09:40.830
Are you sure about this?

09:40.830 --> 09:45.900
I can announce to the whole school that
you're living with Senior Akane, you know?

09:45.900 --> 09:46.900
Is this a blackmail?!

09:46.900 --> 09:49.110
Oh, please! It's not!

09:49.110 --> 09:53.450
It's just a humble request from a girl
to visit her lovely boyfriend's house.

09:53.450 --> 09:56.910
You'll grant me that wish
since you're kind, right?

09:58.140 --> 09:59.540
Have it your way.

09:59.540 --> 10:03.040
Yay! I love you, Senior!

10:05.540 --> 10:07.680
You're late.
What were you...

10:08.790 --> 10:10.160
What is going on here...

10:10.160 --> 10:13.260
Akane! Calm down and listen to me!
This is...

10:13.260 --> 10:15.760
Why are you with my little sister?

10:15.760 --> 10:18.510
Huh? Whose what now?

10:18.510 --> 10:21.980
My sister! She's Maho Sakuramori!

10:21.980 --> 10:24.020
Didn't she tell you?

10:24.020 --> 10:25.550
Sakuramori?

10:25.550 --> 10:28.620
Ah, she found out! Tee-hee!

10:30.530 --> 10:33.280
Sis!

10:34.960 --> 10:38.530
I'm back, I'm back, I'm back!
I missed you!

10:38.530 --> 10:40.790
Maho, have some restraint.

10:42.530 --> 10:45.920
You smell good...

10:45.920 --> 10:49.570
Geez, what a spoiled girl you are.

10:51.810 --> 10:55.770
Your boobs are so soft!
Did they grow bigger again?

10:55.770 --> 10:57.440
No, they didn't!

10:57.440 --> 11:02.180
Yes, they did. My body remembers
the size of your boobs.

11:02.560 --> 11:03.180
Poke.

11:03.180 --> 11:04.310
Kyah!

11:04.310 --> 11:08.810
Gosh, you're just too cute, I can't!

11:08.810 --> 11:10.820
Cut it out already!

11:13.100 --> 11:15.570
Ouch, that hurts, Sis...

11:15.570 --> 11:18.050
Sorry. Are you hurt?

11:18.050 --> 11:19.760
Nah, I was just joking!

11:19.760 --> 11:22.710
You held back, so it didn't hurt at all!

11:22.710 --> 11:24.350
Come on now...

11:24.740 --> 11:28.210
Didn't you lose your sister...

11:28.210 --> 11:31.460
I never said she died.

11:32.100 --> 11:33.960
But you said...

11:34.530 --> 11:36.460
She's not around anymore.

11:36.460 --> 11:39.220
She's already somewhere far away.

11:39.770 --> 11:42.470
Didn't you say that as you cried?

11:42.470 --> 11:44.480
I went on a trip abroad!

11:44.880 --> 11:46.210
Abroad?

11:46.210 --> 11:51.040
Yep! I, as cute as I am, begged my grandma
for some money, and she gave me!

11:51.040 --> 11:53.810
That's why I was on a tour since
my senior year in middle school,

11:53.810 --> 11:55.970
and I was only back to Japan recently!

11:55.970 --> 11:56.990
For real?

11:56.990 --> 12:00.990
Well, then. Time for me
to investigate your married life.

12:00.990 --> 12:02.330
Investigate?

12:02.330 --> 12:04.570
Did Grandma ask you to do this?

12:04.570 --> 12:06.250
No, she didn't.

12:06.250 --> 12:10.370
As your little sister, I must know
how your married life is going, no?

12:10.370 --> 12:11.860
Married life?!

12:11.860 --> 12:14.250
Anyway, I'll go check your bedroom!

12:14.250 --> 12:15.090
Wait!

12:15.740 --> 12:16.840
Found it!

12:17.220 --> 12:20.000
What the? There's two pillows here.

12:20.000 --> 12:22.600
I mean, it's a bed for two...

12:22.600 --> 12:27.600
For two? You're not saying you
sleep together every night, are you?

12:28.030 --> 12:29.230
I am.

12:29.230 --> 12:30.190
How far have you gone?!

12:30.190 --> 12:31.240
We haven't done anything!

12:31.240 --> 12:31.860
Liar!

12:31.860 --> 12:36.110
You've definitely done it!
Especially when you sleep together every night!

12:37.180 --> 12:38.310
My sister's first time!

12:38.310 --> 12:39.270
I'll kill you!

12:39.270 --> 12:40.090
You're a dead man!

12:40.090 --> 12:42.120
I told you, we haven't done it yet!

12:42.120 --> 12:44.610
Really real? You haven't kissed yet?

12:44.610 --> 12:47.500
Of course!
I can't do something so disgusting!

12:47.500 --> 12:49.130
Have you held hands?

12:49.130 --> 12:50.350
No...

12:50.350 --> 12:51.560
I see.

12:51.560 --> 12:53.630
So there's no doing it half-asleep,

12:53.630 --> 12:56.630
or getting in a good mood and just
going with the flow moment?

12:56.630 --> 12:59.410
As if I'd get in a good mood with him.

12:59.410 --> 13:03.680
I wonder. You've at least fantasised
about each other, right?

13:03.680 --> 13:04.390
No way!

13:06.510 --> 13:11.630
But, I guess I should watch over you
so nothing fishy will happen.

13:11.630 --> 13:15.650
I'll stay over tonight
and observe your night life.

13:15.650 --> 13:20.400
Having you under the same roof
makes me anxious, though.

13:20.400 --> 13:24.160
Huh? Does that mean
you might actually assault me?

13:24.160 --> 13:26.040
You're a beast, Bro!

13:26.040 --> 13:30.790
Saito, lay a finger on her, and I'll surgically
tear off your limbs without anesthetics!

13:30.790 --> 13:33.170
Yeah, that's not a surgery!
That's torture!

13:33.170 --> 13:37.670
Please, Sis! I want to eat
your cooking after some time!

13:37.670 --> 13:41.260
Of course, you can stay
as long as you want.

13:41.260 --> 13:44.060
Yay! You're so kind, Sis!

13:45.050 --> 13:46.810
This brat...

13:48.310 --> 13:50.810
I'll make you a lot of porridge, then.

13:50.810 --> 13:51.940
For dinner?!

13:51.940 --> 13:54.940
Yes, now that Maho is back here.

13:54.940 --> 13:57.820
Not porridge!
Anything but that, please!

13:57.820 --> 14:00.440
Why do you hate porridge so much?

14:00.440 --> 14:05.420
She'd always feed me porridge
when I was on my bed as a kid... I'm sick of it.

14:05.420 --> 14:06.210
Got it.

14:06.210 --> 14:06.980
Sis...

14:06.980 --> 14:09.450
I'll add dried plum just for today.

14:09.450 --> 14:11.970
That's not the issue here!

14:12.460 --> 14:15.530
I love Sis' porridge...

14:15.530 --> 14:18.940
I just have to keep saying that to myself...

14:18.940 --> 14:21.470
It gets easier when I do...

14:21.470 --> 14:25.970
I guess we could use some protein too.
Do we still have eggs...

14:28.470 --> 14:31.230
Hey, Shisei!
What are you doing here?!

14:31.230 --> 14:32.540
She's gone cold...

14:32.540 --> 14:35.600
It's a new fridge with high specs...

14:39.940 --> 14:43.410
I am requesting a CPR from you, Cousin.

14:43.410 --> 14:44.740
Yeah, she's alive.

14:44.740 --> 14:46.990
Found Shii!

14:47.360 --> 14:49.550
Leave the CPR to me!

14:49.550 --> 14:53.090
No, thank you.
Only he is allowed to touch my lips.

14:53.090 --> 14:56.580
Bro, give her to me!
I'll make sure she gets all the love!

14:56.580 --> 14:59.290
As her older brother,
I won't let you have her!

14:59.290 --> 15:04.810
Why is she calling you Bro?

15:04.810 --> 15:07.550
I'm your only little sister...

15:07.550 --> 15:11.230
She's my sister's darling,
so that makes him my brother!

15:11.230 --> 15:12.690
Right, Bro?

15:14.390 --> 15:17.220
That's my place...

15:17.220 --> 15:18.310
I challenge you!

15:18.310 --> 15:19.970
To what?

15:19.970 --> 15:24.910
To see who has the most little sister power,
befitting of a spot next to him!

15:25.360 --> 15:27.070
LITTLE SISTER POWER MATCH!

15:27.070 --> 15:28.320
Huh?

15:28.750 --> 15:31.080
Here I go, then!

15:31.080 --> 15:31.790
Huh?!

15:33.580 --> 15:39.590
Hey, if you make me your little sister,
I'll do something nice for you.

15:39.590 --> 15:41.710
Hey, what are you doing, Maho?!

15:42.070 --> 15:45.550
What do you say?
Isn't my little sister power something?

15:45.550 --> 15:46.470
How would you rate it?

15:46.470 --> 15:47.220
Zero points.

15:47.220 --> 15:48.690
Huh? Why?

15:48.690 --> 15:50.220
It's too erotic as a little sister.

15:50.220 --> 15:54.790
You're no good.
Only I am worthy of being his little sister.

15:54.790 --> 15:58.730
Witness the charm of little sister
I've honed for years!

15:58.730 --> 16:01.230
LITTLE SISTER POWER MATCH!
ROUND TWO

16:06.460 --> 16:09.240
Cousin, carry me...

16:12.490 --> 16:14.240
Carry me...

16:16.250 --> 16:20.250
That's a perfect 100!

16:20.720 --> 16:21.670
V.

16:21.670 --> 16:25.420
It's frustrating,
but I'll just have to admit she's cute.

16:25.850 --> 16:29.120
So much that I'd honestly
want her as my sister too.

16:29.120 --> 16:30.590
Don't worry, Maho.

16:30.590 --> 16:33.510
You'll always be my number one little sister.

16:33.510 --> 16:38.090
Sis... You're also my number one in the world!

16:38.090 --> 16:38.750
Maho!

16:38.750 --> 16:40.460
Sis!

16:45.710 --> 16:48.970
We're finally alone!

16:48.970 --> 16:51.200
Now I feel like at home.

16:51.200 --> 16:54.940
Why didn't you text me
if you were going back to Japan?

16:54.940 --> 16:56.700
I've missed you so much.

16:56.700 --> 17:00.330
I thought I'd surprise you.
Did I succeed?

17:00.330 --> 17:05.090
Big time. Especially when I saw you
in Saito's arm earlier.

17:05.090 --> 17:08.540
Never mind that,
I have a proposal for you.

17:08.540 --> 17:09.330
Hmm?

17:09.850 --> 17:12.340
Should I marry him?

17:12.340 --> 17:13.070
Huh?

17:13.910 --> 17:17.310
Our grandmother and his grandfather's goal...

17:17.310 --> 17:22.480
...is to hook up their grandchildren as
a revenge for their lost love in the past, no?

17:22.480 --> 17:25.480
It sounds troubling,
but it is true.

17:25.480 --> 17:29.030
In that case,
I can do it instead.

17:29.030 --> 17:32.770
I'll go negotiate with Grandma
and make sure your tuitions are still paid.

17:32.770 --> 17:33.990
How's that sound?

17:34.400 --> 17:35.510
Well...

17:36.070 --> 17:39.370
I don't think you can keep up with him.

17:39.370 --> 17:40.370
Why?

17:40.370 --> 17:43.420
I mean, he's so egoistic.

17:43.420 --> 17:46.130
He always puts himself first
so arrogantly.

17:46.130 --> 17:47.780
Don't worry!

17:47.780 --> 17:52.130
He might have the best brains,
but nothing can top my cuteness!

17:52.130 --> 17:56.690
He can't cook properly, and always
eats cup noodles when I'm not looking.

17:56.690 --> 17:58.910
I also love cup noodles.

17:59.940 --> 18:02.910
He always plays the creepy
zombie killing game too!

18:02.910 --> 18:05.850
Shooting zombies sounds fun!

18:07.150 --> 18:08.150
What?

18:08.590 --> 18:10.670
Are you sure about this?

18:10.670 --> 18:13.410
Don't you want to marry someone you love?

18:14.180 --> 18:17.910
I still don't know his personality,
but I like his face.

18:17.910 --> 18:19.660
Huh...

18:19.660 --> 18:21.540
Here, take a look.

18:21.540 --> 18:24.540
We're already this close with each other.

18:24.540 --> 18:29.180
He had burger sauce on his finger
so I licked it clean for him.

18:29.180 --> 18:32.070
He was so happy, saying,
"You look like a puppy, so cute."

18:32.070 --> 18:34.550
You're kidding! Saito would never...

18:34.550 --> 18:37.800
It's true. I sucked it dry.

18:37.800 --> 18:39.850
You guys just met today, right?

18:39.850 --> 18:40.810
Yep.

18:40.810 --> 18:44.180
But I guess we're just made for each other.

18:44.180 --> 18:46.670
We'll be a lovey-dovey couple
if we get married,

18:46.670 --> 18:48.190
and you can rest easy.

18:48.560 --> 18:50.940
Well, I guess I can...

18:50.940 --> 18:54.910
Glad to hear that!
Leave him to me!

18:54.910 --> 18:56.880
I'll go bond with him some more!

18:56.880 --> 18:57.950
Wait!

19:00.910 --> 19:04.460
Why did I try to stop her?

19:05.260 --> 19:07.710
Am I feeling sick?

19:10.210 --> 19:14.970
Bro! I, the cute Maho,
am here to wash your back!

19:14.970 --> 19:17.150
My back's already clean! Go away!

19:17.150 --> 19:20.590
So you want me to clean
your other amazing part? What a pervert.

19:20.590 --> 19:21.740
What do you mean by that?

19:21.740 --> 19:24.100
Of course, I'm talking about your duodenum!

19:24.430 --> 19:26.470
Now that's something...

19:27.100 --> 19:31.300
Try to run away, and I'll tell her
that you tried to assault me.

19:31.300 --> 19:34.240
Akane's not one to believe such nonsense.

19:34.240 --> 19:35.500
I wonder.

19:35.500 --> 19:38.940
Between the words of someone she hates,
and the words of her beloved sister...

19:38.940 --> 19:41.240
Which one will she believe?

19:41.240 --> 19:42.990
Of course it's me.

19:42.990 --> 19:47.000
What do you say, Bro?
You'll allow me to bond with you, right?

19:47.000 --> 19:48.410
Suit yourself.

19:50.000 --> 19:53.260
Hey, have you got in together with her?

19:53.260 --> 19:54.010
No.

19:54.010 --> 19:56.720
How about other girls?
Other than your family?

19:56.720 --> 19:57.510
None.

19:57.510 --> 20:02.260
That makes me the first then.
You're also the first guy I go in together with.

20:02.950 --> 20:05.970
Hey, Bro. Let's get married.

20:05.970 --> 20:07.770
Huh? What do you mean?

20:07.770 --> 20:11.270
Our grandmother and your grandfather...

20:11.270 --> 20:14.280
They just want their grandchildren
to marry each other, right?

20:14.280 --> 20:16.030
You're right...

20:16.030 --> 20:18.630
In that case, wouldn't I do?

20:18.630 --> 20:24.040
I'm pretty loyal, and I'll let you
do anything you want to me.

20:24.040 --> 20:25.410
Anything...

20:25.410 --> 20:26.950
All of it.

20:26.950 --> 20:31.670
If you only say yes,
my body is yours to play with.

20:31.670 --> 20:35.800
I'll do anything you want me to do.

20:36.830 --> 20:39.800
Could you...
give me some time to think.

20:40.160 --> 20:43.810
Would my sister get in the bath with you?

20:44.270 --> 20:48.190
Would she accept your wishes
and desires as they are?

20:48.190 --> 20:51.690
She wouldn't, right? But I will.

20:52.180 --> 20:56.210
I will become a mirror for your desires.

20:59.970 --> 21:02.200
You seem tired.

21:02.200 --> 21:03.450
What happened?

21:03.450 --> 21:06.320
Your sister keeps swaying me about...

21:06.320 --> 21:09.440
She's just too carefree and cheerful...

21:09.440 --> 21:13.210
I'm happy that she can be
so lively like that.

21:13.770 --> 21:17.430
She was always bedridden
in the hospital since little,

21:17.430 --> 21:19.770
so I was worried sick.

21:19.770 --> 21:24.250
If Maho can live a happy life,
then that makes me happy too.

21:24.250 --> 21:29.230
She might be too selfish sometimes,
but I want to answer to that too.

21:29.660 --> 21:33.230
I want her to enjoy life more.

21:35.050 --> 21:38.710
Hey, I have a question for you.

21:38.710 --> 21:39.860
What?

21:40.500 --> 21:43.430
Saito, are you thinking of
breaking up with me?

21:43.430 --> 21:44.240
Huh?

21:44.630 --> 21:46.450
Why ask that?

21:46.450 --> 21:48.750
I'm just a bit curious.

21:48.750 --> 21:54.730
Why are you curious?
If I said so, would you do that?

21:54.730 --> 21:57.000
Um... Well...

22:00.690 --> 22:01.850
Hang on...

22:03.010 --> 22:04.370
What do I want to do?

23:35.020 --> 23:41.110
#9 SISTER'S HEART
